{"name":"【静物写生】复杂物件 · 木构小屋01","thumbnail":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","camera":{"pos":[4.652,3.87,5.979],"target":[1.454,1.857,2.259],"zoom":0.52},"light":{"type":"rect","azimuth":0,"elevation":27,"distance":19,"temp":45,"size":19.3,"intensity":5.3},"env":{"hasWall":false,"defaultMat":"origin","posterizeLevel":0,"wallColor":"#cccccc","groundColor":"#cccccc","skyColor":"#000000","skyLightScale":0,"atmosphere":{"enabled":false,"density":0.01,"type":"height","color":"#ffffff","p1":4.3,"p2":1.1},"dof":{"enabled":false,"aperture":2.9,"focusDistance":10},"lightIndicatorEnabled":true},"crop":{"display":"block","left":"566px","top":"88px","width":"632.2px","height":"632.2px"},"items":[{"type":"builtin","shape":"sphere","pos":[1.852,0.197,-0.036],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.098,0.098,0.098],"color":"#ccc5bd"},{"type":"glb","url":"/docs/model/静物_其它_tavern_medieval_house_opt.glb","pos":[-0.299,0,0],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[8,8,8]}],"groundAnnotations":[],"groundNormArrows":[],"groundPolygon3ds":[],"groundColorSampleAnnotations":[],"meta":{"detail":"<b>静物写生 · 木构小屋</b>\n\n房子细节很多，先别盯窗格和木梁。\n先看成几块大面：墙、顶、暗部，明暗先站住。","category":"静物写生","keyPoints":"【静物写生】复杂物件 · 木构小屋。\n\n这一幅要练的，是建筑先看大块面。\n\n小屋有屋顶、山墙、木梁、窗格、石基，细节一多就容易抠。先把它看成几块大面：哪一面墙朝光，哪一面转入暗，屋顶怎么斜过去，屋檐底下哪里更沉。大面的明暗关系站住了，房子才有体积，才站得住。\n\n窗格、木条、饰件可以后说。它们要贴在大面上，服从整座房子的亮暗，不要一上来就画成一张“花纹说明书”。右边小球只是对照光向用的。\n\n请记住：画建筑，先大块面，后小构件。大关系稳了，小屋才立得住。"}}